--  LOCK STATE — TRUE NEUTRAL
--
--  Lock.on=true  + Lock.target=nil  → NEUTRAL  (no aim, no constraint)
--  Lock.on=true  + Lock.target=X   → ACTIVE   (aim + AlignOrientation)
--  Lock.on=false                   → OFF
--
--  Lock.target is ONLY set inside LockOn().
